  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What did Hari Singh realize about Anil's habit of celebrating every payday?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It made him suspicious and worried"},{"id":"b","text":"He was pleased with the celebration parties"},{"id":"c","text":"Anil never spent his money on anything meaningful"},{"id":"d","text":"All of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How did Hari Singh feel when he heard about the publisher buying Anil's story?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He was disappointed that Anil didn't make more money"},{"id":"b","text":"He thought it would be hard to get away with stealing from Anil now"},{"id":"c","text":"Anil had written something interesting and valuable enough for a publisher"},{"id":"d","text":"All of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What did Hari Singh do when he saw his employer hiding money under the mattress?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He took it for himself"},{"id":"b","text":"He complained to someone about Anil's dishonesty"},{"id":"c","text":"He tried to help him come up with a plan to hide more money"},{"id":"d","text":"He told Anil he would not be taking his pay from that time on"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How did Hari Singh feel about stealing after working for Anil for almost a month?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It was difficult and risky because of Anil’s carelessness"},{"id":"b","text":"He felt like he could do it again as a challenge"},{"id":"c","text":"Anil's trust made him want to take his pay more seriously"},{"id":"d","text":"All of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What did Hari Singh do with the extra money Anil gave him?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He used it to buy clothes for himself"},{"id":"b","text":"He kept it in his pocket and tried to use it secretly"},{"id":"c","text":"He spent some of it, keeping a small amount for himself"},{"id":"d","text":"He asked Anil to give more money as he was not satisfied with the pay"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which of these statements is NOT supported by the text?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Hari Singh had already tried other jobs without success before meeting Anil"},{"id":"b","text":"Anil gave Hari Singh a key to his room so he could come and go as he pleased"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh was not happy with Anil’s way of making money"},{"id":"d","text":"All of the above statements are supported by the text"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What did Hari Singh realize about his past employers when he thought about stealing?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"They were greedy and easily taken advantage of"},{"id":"b","text":"He had cheated them out of money before without being caught"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh realized that his past experiences made him more likely to rob now"},{"id":"d","text":"None of the above"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What did Hari Singh do after he learned how to add numbers?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He started planning a robbery with Anil"},{"id":"b","text":"He continued working for Anil as before"},{"id":"c","text":"He asked Anil for more money so he could start stealing"},{"id":"d","text":"He became frustrated and decided not to work anymore"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How did Hari Singh feel when he realized he would be able to add numbers like a learned man?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It made him happy because it meant he could steal more easily"},{"id":"b","text":"He was upset because he had been caught before"},{"id":"c","text":"It gave him hope that his skills would help him in the future"},{"id":"d","text":"He felt disappointed and decided to leave Anil's service"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Who does ‘I’ refer to in this story?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Anil"},{"id":"b","text":"'I' is referring to the thief who approaches Anil"},{"id":"c","text":"'I' is a misnomer used by Anil for Hari Singh"},{"id":"d","text":"The police"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does the thief consider doing immediately after Anil's initial rejection?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Taking them along with him on the train to Lucknow"},{"id":"b","text":"Running away with the money and staying somewhere else"},{"id":"c","text":"Buying a new set of clothes"},{"id":"d","text":"Going back to work for Anil"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why does Anil give the thief food he cooked that night?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Because it was too good for him to waste on dogs"},{"id":"b","text":"He wanted the dog to get sick so it wouldn't be able to eat anything else"},{"id":"c","text":"Anil doesn't like his own cooking and prefers dog food"},{"id":"d","text":"The thief had asked Anil to feed him if he cooked a meal"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh's act of stealing suggest about Anil’s character?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He is very trustworthy and generous with his money"},{"id":"b","text":"He lacks self-protection skills and is easily robbed by others"},{"id":"c","text":"Anil likes to spend money on books he writes for magazines"},{"id":"d","text":"Anil doesn’t mind when people cheat him in the store"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh use as a reason not to pay him?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He thinks Anil is too busy writing for magazines and doesn’t have time to pay him"},{"id":"b","text":"He tells Anil he can cook better than Anil, so it’s unfair to pay someone who can do the same job"},{"id":"c","text":"He says he can write sentences as well as Anil"},{"id":"d","text":"He feels that Anil spends too much money on celebrating with his friends"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh decide to do about his theft?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He decides to keep the money and run away immediately"},{"id":"b","text":"He decides to wait until he gets an opportunity to rob someone else"},{"id":"c","text":"He decides to return the notes and confess to Anil"},{"id":"d","text":"He decides to write a letter to the police about what happened"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why does Hari Singh consider stealing from Anil now?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Anil is being greedy with his money and refusing to pay him for work done"},{"id":"b","text":"Hari Singh is tired of working as a thief and wants to return to an honest job"},{"id":"c","text":"He finds out Anil has written a book and is getting rich from it"},{"id":"d","text":"Hari Singh heard that he can easily get away with stealing from Anil without being caught"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does the theft of money suggest about Hari Singh's character?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Hari Singh is more trustworthy than Anil, who keeps wasting his money on celebrations"},{"id":"b","text":"He has developed a sense of responsibility and decides to use the money for himself"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh is not as clever as he thinks he is because he doesn’t realize how difficult it will be to escape detection"},{"id":"d","text":"He is still a thief and has lost his skill at stealing, which made him consider this robbery"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh learn from Anil about writing?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"That he can write like an educated man once he learns how to add numbers properly"},{"id":"b","text":"Anil doesn’t teach him anything since he has no need for it"},{"id":"c","text":"He cannot write whole sentences and needs more lessons with Anil"},{"id":"d","text":"Writing is a crucial skill that will unlock many doors in Hari Singh's life"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does the thief think Anil will react to being robbed?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Anil will be happy because he trusts the thief completely"},{"id":"b","text":"He thinks Anil will feel angry and might not pay him again"},{"id":"c","text":"Anil won’t notice since he’s so trusting of Hari Singh"},{"id":"d","text":"Hari Singh can easily get away with this robbery and won't be caught by the police"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does Hari Singh think a careless man will react to being robbed?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He thinks a careless man will notice immediately and be angry about it"},{"id":"b","text":"A careless man would have no idea he was robbed because of his carelessness"},{"id":"c","text":"Careless men are too busy thinking about their next celebration to worry about money"},{"id":"d","text":"Hari Singh believes that a thief who is as careful as Anil can easily trick him into robbing someone else"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh realize about his ability after being robbed by Anil?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He thinks he needs more practice to be able to steal from Anil again"},{"id":"b","text":"Hari Singh realizes that stealing is not the answer and decides to return home"},{"id":"c","text":"Anil taught him how to cook properly, so now Hari Singh can only rob someone else who knows how to cook better than Anil"},{"id":"d","text":"He thinks he needs more practice because his old skills are rusty and easy to spot by Anil"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does the thief feel about the money after stealing from Anil?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It is enough for a week or two of living like an oil-rich Arab"},{"id":"b","text":"He feels he can use it to purchase many items without being caught again"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh thinks that Anil will notice him and have a fit if he uses the money before stealing from someone else"},{"id":"d","text":"He knows he won’t be able to keep the money for long due to police suspicion and surveillance"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why does Hari Singh decide not to run away with the money?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Hari Singh decides not to run because Anil is a trustworthy person who would notice him stealing from him"},{"id":"b","text":"He feels that Anil’s friends won’t be there to see him if he runs"},{"id":"c","text":"Anil has taught him enough skills and Hari Singh wants to prove himself more by staying"},{"id":"d","text":"Hari Singh decides not to run because he is now confident in his ability to escape detection"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does the thief think Anil will do with the money after it's gone?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Anil will be angry and demand that Hari Singh return it immediately"},{"id":"b","text":"Anil won’t notice since he’s so trusting of Hari Singh"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh knows Anil would waste it on his friends because Anil is so careless with money"},{"id":"d","text":"He doesn’t think about what Anil will do, just that Anil won’t mind him using the money as he trusts Hari Singh"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh learn from Anil’s celebration of receiving a cheque?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"That he needs to be more careful and not trust people who have such big celebrations for their earnings"},{"id":"b","text":"He can use this knowledge to become an author himself one day"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh realizes that it’s best to wait until Anil is out of town before stealing from him again"},{"id":"d","text":"Anil never celebrates his earnings, so Hari Singh learns to take the money right away when he sees a cheque in Anil's room"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why does Hari Singh think it's difficult to rob someone who is careless?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Because the person will be angry at being robbed and won’t notice it"},{"id":"b","text":"Careless people are too busy celebrating their earnings to even notice they’re being robbed"},{"id":"c","text":"He thinks he can easily trick a careless person into robbing him for money or something else valuable without getting caught"},{"id":"d","text":"He believes that if the person is so careless, then Hari Singh won’t be able to steal anything from them and will need to find someone more trustworthy"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh realize about himself after stealing from Anil?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"That he can only use a little money before being noticed by the police or Anil’s friends"},{"id":"b","text":"He learns that Anil is always on edge because of his fear of getting caught and will try to return any money he sees in Hari Singh's possession immediately"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh realizes that he doesn’t need to be careful anymore since he already has the money"},{"id":"d","text":"That he can use all the money without being noticed and keep it for himself"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does Hari Singh feel about Anil’s character after learning he writes books for magazines?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He feels that it's even more important to stay in touch with Anil because now he has something valuable to sell to other people who read these books"},{"id":"b","text":"Hari Singh realizes he can only be a thief since his skills don’t match up with those of Anil, the author"},{"id":"c","text":"He thinks that writing books is a waste of time and energy, so Hari Singh decides not to follow in Anil’s footsteps as a writer"},{"id":"d","text":"Hari Singh believes that if he can only learn how to write like Anil, he will be able to continue stealing from him without being caught or punished"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does the theft suggest about Hari Singh's understanding of himself?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He has learned a lot about himself and is more careful in his actions after this experience"},{"id":"b","text":"Hari Singh realizes that he can only steal if he knows how to write like Anil, who wrote books for magazines"},{"id":"c","text":"The thief believes he needs to keep working as a thief until he finds someone more careless than Anil"},{"id":"d","text":"He thinks he will be able to use the money he stole from Anil to pay off his debts and start a new life free of any legal troubles, like Anil who is always celebrating with friends"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh consider doing after stealing from Anil?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He considers telling the police what happened so Anil gets in trouble for wasting money on celebrations"},{"id":"b","text":"Hari Singh decides to return home and start a new life as he thinks he can’t steal anymore without being caught"},{"id":"c","text":"The thief believes that if he keeps stealing, he will eventually get away with it until the police notice it was him doing it again"},{"id":"d","text":"He considers writing a letter to Anil explaining what happened so he won't be in trouble"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does Hari Singh's decision not to run away suggest his character?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Hari Singh is greedy and only cares about the money, not any future consequences of stealing from Anil again"},{"id":"b","text":"He values trustworthiness over greed and understands he won't be able to keep this money without getting caught"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh thinks that if he doesn’t tell anyone what happened, no one will know he stole anything from Anil"},{"id":"d","text":"The thief believes that stealing is the only option left for him since his skills are rusty and easily noticed by Anil"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh consider doing after learning about Anil’s celebration of receiving a cheque?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He decides to return home and start living an honest life like he did before"},{"id":"b","text":"Hari Singh thinks that since Anil will be out of town, he can take the money then run away safely"},{"id":"c","text":"The thief believes that if he keeps stealing from people who have big celebrations for their earnings, he won’t get caught again as easily as with someone like Anil"},{"id":"d","text":"Hari Singh decides to start writing books himself and earn his living in a different way than Anil"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does Hari Singh realize that he needs to be more careful after stealing from Anil?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"He realizes that if the police notice him, he won't be able to get away with it anymore"},{"id":"b","text":"The thief learns that he can only use a little money before being noticed by the police or Anil’s friends"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh decides to start living an honest life because his skills are rusty and he needs practice as a writer again"},{"id":"d","text":"He thinks that if he doesn’t get caught, he won’t need to be careful anymore since he already has money from stealing"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$What does Hari Singh think Anil will do with the money after it's gone?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"Anil will be angry and demand that Hari Singh return it immediately"},{"id":"b","text":"Hari Singh thinks that Anil won’t mind him using the money as he trusts Hari Singh"},{"id":"c","text":"He knows that Anil would waste it on his friends because Anil is so careless with money"},{"id":"d","text":"The thief believes he can use all the money without being noticed and keep it for himself"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In the story, the narrator hesitated to buy a ticket because he believed that friends are more like$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"helpful than troublemakers."},{"id":"b","text":"troublesome and troublesome."},{"id":"c","text":"confident and reliable."},{"id":"d","text":"problematic and untrustworthy."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's decision to rob Anil was primarily driven by his perception of Anil as a$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"generous and trusting person."},{"id":"b","text":"cynical and distant individual."},{"id":"c","text":"jealous and envious acquaintance."},{"id":"d","text":"curious and observant companion."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$When the narrator discovered that his stolen money was damp from rain, he realized that$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"he needed to return it immediately."},{"id":"b","text":"the money would be worthless for its intended use."},{"id":"c","text":"he should have taken more precautions before leaving home."},{"id":"d","text":"Anil's trust in him might not recover easily."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's decision to learn reading and writing from Anil was motivated by his belief that$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"writing skills are more important than money."},{"id":"b","text":"he had already stolen enough for a comfortable life."},{"id":"c","text":"Anil could teach him what he needed to know."},{"id":"d","text":"reading and writing alone would give him power and respect."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's behavior suggests that his perception of friends as more trouble than help was based on their$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"lack of understanding or assistance during the theft."},{"id":"b","text":"ability to provide financial support during the crime."},{"id":"c","text":"history of making insincere compliments and flattery."},{"id":"d","text":"past experiences in which friends betrayed him."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$d$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's decision to return Anil’s money, despite being caught, was influenced by his understanding that$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"the amount stolen would lead to immediate detection."},{"id":"b","text":"he could learn from his mistake and gain respect."},{"id":"c","text":"Anil had already made a profit from the theft."},{"id":"d","text":"returning the money would maintain their relationship."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator’s choice of hiding Anil's money under the mattress, rather than immediately handing it over, was because he$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"expected Anil to notice and return it as a mark of his good deed."},{"id":"b","text":"wanted to test if Anil would discover his hidden notes."},{"id":"c","text":"feared that Anil might not be home in the morning, delaying payment."},{"id":"d","text":"had a plan to use the money for future thefts."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's fear of being discovered upon returning the stolen money was due to his worry about$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"whether he would be able to return it without raising suspicion."},{"id":"b","text":"the potential legal consequences of theft."},{"id":"c","text":"Anil’s reaction and possible future actions based on this incident."},{"id":"d","text":"his own feelings of guilt over the crime committed."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$When Anil said, 'I made some money yesterday,' he was$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"making an excuse to avoid paying back the narrator."},{"id":"b","text":"trying to imply that his income had increased unexpectedly."},{"id":"c","text":"reminding the narrator of a recent incident where they exchanged notes."},{"id":"d","text":"hiding the fact that he didn't have enough money for payment."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The phrase 'unlined' in the glossary is used to describe$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"a person who does not have any worries or anxieties."},{"id":"b","text":"an appearance showing no anxiety or worry, like a blank sheet of paper."},{"id":"c","text":"someone who has lined their pockets with money and has nothing left to hide."},{"id":"d","text":"a person who is very secretive and does not show anything about what they have done."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's decision to return Anil’s money was primarily motivated by$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"his fear of being caught for the theft he committed."},{"id":"b","text":"his realization that writing skills could bring more value than mere money."},{"id":"c","text":"Anil's willingness to pay him back with a note."},{"id":"d","text":"the narrator's desire to maintain his friendship with Anil."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The thief’s story reveals the depth of$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"his desperation for money and power."},{"id":"b","text":"his understanding of human behavior during thefts."},{"id":"c","text":"how he manipulates people to get what he needs without being caught."},{"id":"d","text":"the importance of friendship in overcoming theft."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's reflection on his actions indicates that he had a$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"pessimistic outlook towards life and human nature."},{"id":"b","text":"ambitious goal to become respectable and learned, but was initially afraid of being caught."},{"id":"c","text":"contentment with his current lifestyle as an unlined thief."},{"id":"d","text":"a belief that friendship can always solve any problem a thief faces."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's actions in the story are driven by a desire to$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"remain undiscovered and maintain his reputation as a successful criminal."},{"id":"b","text":"understand human nature better, especially through observing Anil’s face."},{"id":"c","text":"learn how to write and read sentences, which he believes could be more valuable than money in the long run."},{"id":"d","text":"avoid getting caught for theft by learning from Anil’s mistakes."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's choice of hiding the stolen money under Anil's mattress is an example of$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"a sneaky and untrustworthy person trying to cover up his crime."},{"id":"b","text":"a thief who understands human behavior enough to use it for his own benefit."},{"id":"c","text":"an honest person who decides to return the stolen money based on a moral decision, despite potential risks."},{"id":"d","text":"someone who is too lazy or careless to directly give back the money he stole."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's final statement that 'I should go back to Anil' reveals his innermost thought as$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"he wants to continue robbing him, but in a more subtle way."},{"id":"b","text":"an understanding of himself and his need for personal growth."},{"id":"c","text":"fear of being caught by the police if he doesn’t return the money."},{"id":"d","text":"his realization that friendship is stronger than trust in criminals."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator's hesitance to jump into one of the carriages of the train could be interpreted as a$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"fear of being caught by law enforcement, despite his criminal history."},{"id":"b","text":"an internal conflict between loyalty to friends and the desire for freedom from crime."},{"id":"c","text":"the realization that he might need to pay back Anil's money later."},{"id":"d","text":"a lack of confidence in his abilities as a thief."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator’s decision to seek help from Anil, despite being caught stealing, reflects his belief that$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"he can learn something valuable from someone he has wronged."},{"id":"b","text":"the experience could provide him with information on how to better deceive people in the future."},{"id":"c","text":"he needs more money to pay back the stolen amount."},{"id":"d","text":"Anil is a trustworthy friend who will not report his theft to the authorities."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator’s final exchange of money with Anil suggests that$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"he has learned to be more cautious in committing future crimes."},{"id":"b","text":"he is trying to maintain their friendship by making a small repayment."},{"id":"c","text":"Anil's actions indicate he might have been dishonest about his income, leading the narrator to question the situation further."},{"id":"d","text":"the narrator was tricked into thinking Anil owed him money from earlier thefts."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The phrase 'I can’t cook his meals' suggests that the narrator$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"was too busy committing crimes to have time for cooking."},{"id":"b","text":"had no desire to continue living with Anil as a thief, preferring to work for money."},{"id":"c","text":"understood the importance of not making unnecessary demands on friends who had wronged him."},{"id":"d","text":"realized that cooking could be a way to build trust and create value in their relationship."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The narrator’s final statement 'Today we’ll start writing sentences' implies$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"he will return Anil's money but still has plans for future thefts."},{"id":"b","text":"his plan is to continue living with Anil and learn how to read/write as a form of restitution."},{"id":"c","text":"the narrator’s relationship with Anil is complex, involving both learning and the need for payment."},{"id":"d","text":"Anil will be paid off in full without any future plans or actions."}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$c$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
