  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Why does the author mention 'Vanka' by Anton Chekhov in the suggested reading?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"To provide a contrast to the story's theme of redemption through education"},{"id":"b","text":"To show that this type of situation is not unique to India or fiction"},{"id":"c","text":"To offer another short story with characters who have been caught as thieves"},{"id":"d","text":"To emphasize Chekhov’s focus on rural life in his stories"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$b$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$How does Hari Singh's change of heart affect the balance between trust and suspicion?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"It creates a stronger bond of friendship and mutual respect"},{"id":"b","text":"It erodes Anil's belief that people can be trusted without proof"},{"id":"c","text":"It has no significant impact on their relationship dynamics"},{"id":"d","text":"It leads to Hari Singh becoming suspicious of other employers"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Which detail in the story best illustrates Hari Singh’s transformation from thief to potential good citizen?$qbx$, 'mcq'::question_type, $qbx$[{"id":"a","text":"His decision to return to Anil"},{"id":"b","text":"Anil's decision to employ him despite knowing he was a thief"},{"id":"c","text":"Hari Singh's refusal of more money when offered by Anil"},{"id":"d","text":"The way Hari Singh describes his thoughts and feelings about education"}]$qbx$::jsonb, $qbx$a$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
