  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In Hari Singh’s earliest thoughts, he dreams of ________ more than a few hundred rupees.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$whole sentences$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Hari Singh initially thought his path to becoming a ‘really big man’ involved stealing, which is why Anil employs him despite knowing of the boy's past criminal record. This reflects on Anil’s character as an employer who sees ________ opportunity in him.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$appealing$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The story introduces a thief named Hari Singh who makes friends with Anil, a writer struggling to make ends meet. The tale explores the trust and betrayal between them, highlighting that not all characters like Anil are found only in fiction; this line of thinking can be seen as ________.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$unlined$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil’s employment of Hari Singh underscores his ________, a trait evident in the way he trusts the boy despite knowing of his criminal history. This trust, though misguided, shows that Anil is a character who looks for ________ opportunities in others.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$modestly$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Hari Singh’s first thoughts reveal him to be someone with a strong desire for success and power, but his later reflections hint at an internal conflict. This internal struggle can be characterized as he starts to see the difference between simple crime and becoming a respected ________.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$big man$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The story’s setting provides critical clues about language use among its characters. It is known that Anil, who speaks English fluently, employs Hari Singh, a boy from a different background. Which of the following languages are most likely spoken in this environment? ________, ________.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$Hindi$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Hari Singh’s character arc shows a stark contrast between his initial motivations and later thoughts. Anil believes that Hari can be trained to become a man of influence, which aligns with the idea that people like him do not exist only in ________.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$fiction$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The story’s introduction hints at a relationship between Hari Singh and Anil. Despite knowing of the boy’s past, Anil sees potential in him to become something more than just a thief. This belief reflects Anil's willingness to see ________ opportunities in others.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$appealing$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$In his initial thoughts, Hari Singh is driven by insincere praise and the prospect of gaining power and influence. By contrast, his later reflections show a shift towards understanding that true success requires more than simple ________ or respect.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$flattery$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
