  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The character of Hari Singh undergoes a significant change by the end of the story. His earlier ambitions to make money through simple means are contrasted with his later thoughts about gaining ________ from complex sentences.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$respect$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Hari Singh’s return to Anil is marked by a sense of longing for someone who understands and accepts him, despite his criminal past. This suggests that Hari finds himself drawn towards Anil because he perceives a kindred spirit in the form of ________.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$modestly$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil’s employment of Hari Singh is not without its challenges; one such challenge relates to law and order. Despite knowing that Hari could be caught, Anil chooses not to hand him over to the police. This decision reflects a broader theme about human nature, suggesting that many people would have acted differently in similar ________.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$situations$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The story introduces a character who is both a thief and a writer, which adds depth to the narrative. The combination of these roles highlights how complex and multifaceted individuals can be; this complexity makes characters like Hari Singh more ________ than they might initially appear.$qbx$, 'fill_blank'::question_type, NULL, $qbx$real$qbx$, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
