  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Analyze the sequence of events in which Hari Singh attempts to establish a relationship with Anil. What might be considered as the key turning points or significant moments in this process? Discuss how each event contributes to their mutual understanding.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Compare and contrast Hari Singh’s initial reaction to being refused money by Anil versus his response when he discovers that Anil has stolen from him. How does his emotional state shift, if at all, and what implications might this have for the story's resolution?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Analyze how Anil’s occupation as a writer impacts his interactions with Hari Singh. What insights into their relationship can be drawn from this aspect of their lives?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Discuss the role of chance in Hari Singh’s decisions to rob Anil. How does fate or coincidence play a part in the narrative and what might it suggest about the characters' fates?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Examine how Hari Singh's decision-making process changes as he progresses from initially stealing money to contemplating more serious thefts against Anil. What psychological factors seem to be at work here?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Analyze the significance of Hari Singh’s initial lie (about being a wrestler) and subsequent lies about his cooking abilities. How do these fibs influence their relationship dynamics?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Reflect on how Hari Singh's reliance on Anil for survival influences his actions and perceptions towards him. Discuss the potential conflicts or complications that arise from this dependency.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('bfa0d254-e3f5-49df-8b87-39396ed2aa5d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I had been working for Anil for almost a month and apart from cheating on shopping, had not done anything in my line of work. I knew that once I could write like an educated man there would be no limit to what I could achieve.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1e51a615-11e0-4d94-87bb-3cf51e03993c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil made money by fits and starts. He would borrow one week, lend the next. He kept worrying about his next cheque but as soon as it arrived he would go out and celebrate. It seems he wrote for magazines — a queer way to make a living!$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('210cdb63-2b54-42f3-9bc9-bbbb340be36f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$And that is why it was so difficult to rob him. It’s easy to rob a greedy man, because he can afford to be robbed; but it’s difficult to rob a careless man — sometimes he doesn’t even notice he’s been robbed and that takes all the pleasure out of the work.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('67d4a0fe-bd3b-4650-9a8b-6f4312bc8847', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I had a key to the door. I could come and go as I pleased. He was the most trusting person I had ever met.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('65bcb070-c6de-4f39-8239-4fceafca08be', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I can cook, I lied again. If you can cook, then may be I can feed you.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('60a15451-2fe7-45d2-9fdc-e74e0e15f32b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$He also taught me to write my name and said he would soon teach me to write whole sentences and to add numbers. I was grateful.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('6047e3b8-2ee4-425b-a0c0-96b36ef4e378', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$After all, he doesn’t even pay me. I know that the money I’m making is going to be a small percentage compared to what he makes but at least I have something to show for my efforts.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1b5a4eae-579c-4469-8d81-5e66897ca91e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I want to work for you, I said. But I can’t pay you.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c577ff66-8749-4149-b019-016ec1c55fe1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I had every opportunity for doing so. Anil had given me a key to the door, and I could come and go as I pleased.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('84f56aef-b94c-4e26-b341-bcd25855e371', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$The beam of moonlight stepped over the balcony and fell on the bed. I sat up on the floor, considering the situation. If I took the money, I could catch the 10.30 Express to Lucknow.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e863f4d4-1a8e-4174-8e66-fd8207e6e5d0', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I could live like an oil-rich Arab for a week or two.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('9d66bcfa-3ba8-4fb9-a1de-d2589be746d1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil made money by fits and starts. He would borrow one week, lend the next.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d752972c-f971-4453-82f9-2a036724ccc9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I could live like an oil-rich Arab for a week or two. I had every opportunity for doing so but had not done anything in my line of work.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b4c935cc-a6f6-4572-ab92-f43bb3e26424', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I thought that over for a minute. Perhaps I had misjudged my man.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('29a69ed0-a79a-4c84-af30-26cd672233d2', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil’s face was clear and unlined; even I had more marks on my face, though mine were mostly scars.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('acea1fde-5771-4ef3-b6c0-41a47cc9834a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I can cook, I lied again. If you can cook, then may be I can feed you.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('91c69719-2c8f-4f24-ba00-dfd86660b09c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I am not sure what the character meant by 'a queer way to make a living.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f43a1b38-0599-4952-b760-0d228187d747', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$And that is why it was so difficult to rob him. It’s easy to rob a greedy man, because he can afford to be robbed; but it’s difficult to rob a careless man — sometimes he doesn’t even notice he’s been robbed and that takes all the pleasure out of the work.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3d64fb4f-b6cb-4685-b24d-e0efbdc86c44', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I had a key to the door. I could come and go as I pleased.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ea5b415c-3591-4016-bd00-3835fcd5b78a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I slowed down to a walk and counted the notes: 600 rupees in fifties! I could live like an oil-rich Arab for a week or two.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('69b32682-e5ce-403e-b894-cf0cb40312fc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Sometimes he doesn’t even notice he’s been robbed and that takes all the pleasure out of the work.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('53f3407b-d6a4-4a0d-a5a6-1a44fe033ea4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I know that the money I’m making is going to be a small percentage compared to what he makes but at least I have something to show for my efforts.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('74081c13-ca35-4cbc-825f-9b41a133dcc7', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I had every opportunity for doing so but had not done anything in my line of work.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('cbcca17d-9adc-43ec-b810-56e90785780e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I know that the money I’m making is going to be a small percentage compared to what he makes but at least I have something to show for my efforts.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('49a13b6a-9923-47e6-8cef-0b6da755f6b4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$It seems he wrote for magazines — a queer way to make a living!$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('040908d6-52cb-4d0c-9f26-0295f3083ead', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I thought that over for a minute. Perhaps I had misjudged my man.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('adf3cb27-3416-4bd1-988d-8ce937b039a3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I knew that once I could write like an educated man there would be no limit to what I could achieve. It was quite pleasant working for Anil. He made money by fits and starts, borrowing one week, lending the next, worrying about his next cheque, but as soon as it arrived he’d go out and celebrate. It seems he wrote for magazines — a queer way to make a living!$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4bb64b9f-3f58-4a94-bba9-1a51f20b732d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I had been working for Anil for almost a month and, apart from cheating on the shopping, had not done anything in my line of work. I had every opportunity for doing so. Anil had given me a key to the door, and I could come and go as I pleased. He was the most trusting person I had ever met.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('971dd528-7038-467d-973b-62fcde4c5998', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Well, it’s time I did some real work, I told myself; I’m out of practice. And if I don’t take the money, he’ll only waste it on his friends. After all, he doesn’t even pay me.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('18b44d80-7247-4e1a-8404-4609eb8dd451', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil made me learn to write sentences, and I was grateful. I knew that once I could write like an educated man there would be no limit to what I could achieve.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b6b2177f-b5bd-49f0-9787-b6487600e65b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I sat up on the floor, considering the situation. If I took the money, I could catch the 10.30 Express to Lucknow. Slipping out of the blanket, I crept up to the bed. Anil was sleeping peacefully. His face was clear and unlined; even I had more marks on my face, though mine were mostly scars.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('47c63cc6-2695-417c-938f-fb895656db1f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I began to run. I had the notes at my waist, held there by the string of my pyjamas. I slowed down to a walk and counted the notes: 600 rupees in fifties! I could live like an oil-rich Arab for a week or two.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f3d1e157-5623-45f5-959a-65177b6f4395', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil was watching a wrestling match when I approached him. He looked easy-going, kind, and simple enough for my purpose. I hadn’t had much luck of late and thought I might be able to get into the young man’s confidence.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('3c7507f9-8aa2-40c9-aa32-89fcdc0b7144', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I thought that over for a minute. Perhaps I had misjudged my man. I asked, ‘Can you feed me?’ He took me to his room over the Jumna Sweet Shop and told me I could sleep on the balcony.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('2e8d3ecf-4785-4a4d-b87d-9a729560d044', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil made money by fits and starts. He would borrow one week, lend the next. He kept worrying about his next cheque, but as soon as it arrived he would go out and celebrate. It seems he wrote for magazines — a queer way to make a living!$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('fe38d335-85e1-4c2a-9fee-7e841b66b08a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil walked away. I followed casually. ‘Hello again,’ he said. I gave him my most appealing smile. ‘I want to work for you,’ I said. But I couldn’t pay you.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('780740bc-9076-47cf-9d2b-c28ce5ad7b72', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil took me to his room over the Jumna Sweet Shop and told me I could sleep on the balcony. But the meal I cooked that night must have been terrible because Anil gave it to a stray dog and told me to be off. But I just hung around, smiling in my most appealing way.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('cfe9bfe0-833c-41f8-9416-17a6b52227aa', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I didn't have much luck of late and thought I might be able to get into the young man’s confidence. You look a bit of a wrestler yourself, I said. A little flattery helps in making friends.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e41afa31-6178-4864-b560-3bd2e2f4a164', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I thought that over for a minute. Perhaps I had misjudged my man. I asked, ‘Can you feed me?’ He took me to his room over the Jumna Sweet Shop and told me I could sleep on the balcony.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('66ad7706-7ed8-47c2-9448-cf1c1d465370', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I counted the notes: 600 rupees in fifties! I could live like an oil-rich Arab for a week or two.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ef0f6b2b-af4e-421a-a118-884c66f889cb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I began to run. I had the notes at my waist, held there by the string of my pyjamas.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('56a5c4c1-225d-46bd-84b3-c565cd21b78a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$Anil sighed in his sleep and turned on his side, towards me. I was startled and quickly crawled out of the room.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('9208718a-2b61-4f65-9980-81e3f4541b68', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I counted the notes: 600 rupees in fifties! I could live like an oil-rich Arab for a week or two.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('678def2a-848a-4617-a947-db028b9a0796', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '098e09f3-c873-4ada-a489-45a9b6aff536', '21196466-dd9a-4b6e-8c17-75ec1fc474bb', 'd9ec752e-e972-447c-b099-ccf502d554ab', '41e0a701-bdda-403b-bf4d-003aaffa605b', $qbx$I had been working for Anil for almost a month and, apart from cheating on the shopping, had not done anything in my line of work. I had every opportunity for doing so.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-05-22T05-56-28-929Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
